<title>UK: AHB adds 500 million marks to Jan 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>AHB adds 500 million marks to Jan 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypotheken-und Wechel-Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25 PCT  MATURITY    14.JAN 04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *100.65    PAY DATE    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 07.JAN.97 AT</p>
<p>		 97.59</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP</p>
<p>SELL CONC  20 BP -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
